# NestJS services

- `api-gateway`: BFF HTTP; RPC via RabbitMQ (`RmqClientService`); pasta `app/{controllers,services,guards,pipes}`
- Trip / Booking / Payment: `@MessagePattern` na fila do serviço + HTTP só para `/health` e `/metrics`
- Eventos de domínio (`seat.*`, `payment.*`): exchange `bus.fanout` (`@repo/events`)
- Contratos/topics: `@repo/common`
- Prisma clients: `@bus/trip-prisma`, `@bus/booking-prisma`, `@bus/payment-prisma`
- OTEL → `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` (Grafana LGTM); `/metrics` Prometheus
